  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Answered the item's open question at dev 100b6fbb6e: no. Fixture with tests/test_a.py importing pkg.a: 'hypergumbo slice --files <list naming src/pkg/a.py> --minimal' returns a.py and test_a.py while a.py exists, and an EMPTY list once a.py is deleted. smart-test still feeds deleted src paths into the seed. Deletion-only changes reach the full-suite fallback (safe); deletion plus another source edit under-selects. MECHANISM: reverse-slice seed built from the post-change tree, so a deleted module has no symbols and its importers are not reached. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-nifif."  # 8421
